# Vantage Movers Clients — Project Organization

`vantage-movers-clients` is the **public lead-capture marketing site** for Vantage Home Movers (licensed interstate moving broker). It is a Next.js 16 App Router app with **no database** — copy lives in `content/`, leads go to `vantage-main-server` via server-only API calls.

## Stack & Conventions

- **Next.js 16.2** App Router, **React 19**, **Tailwind CSS 4**, React Compiler (`reactCompiler: true`).
- Forms: **React Hook Form + Zod 4** (`@hookform/resolvers/zod`). Icons: **lucide-react** via semantic `IconName` in `types/index.ts` → `components/ui/Icon.tsx`.
- Vercel telemetry: `<Analytics />` and `<SpeedInsights />` are mounted once in `src/app/layout.tsx`; custom marketing events live in `src/lib/analytics.ts`.
- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*`. Package manager: **pnpm** (`pnpm dev`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`).
- Next.js docs for this version live in `.next-docs/` — see `NEXTJS_AGENTS.md` before assuming older Next APIs.

## Folder Ownership

| Path | Owns |
|------|------|
| `src/app/` | Routes, root `layout.tsx`, `globals.css` imports, route handlers, PDF redirect routes |
| `src/components/` | React UI — keep pages thin, compose here |
| `src/content/` | Static copy, nav links, partner config, legal doc data, promo toggles |
| `src/schemas/` | Zod schemas shared by client form + API routes (`quote-form.schema.ts`) |
| `src/lib/` | Pure helpers (`utils`, `format`, `estimate`) + `lib/vantage/server.ts` (server-only backend seam) |
| `src/hooks/` | Client hooks (`useStickyHeader`, `usePromoTrigger`, scroll/lock helpers) |
| `src/types/` | Shared domain TypeScript types (`SiteConfig`, `LegalDoc`, `SceneName`, etc.) |
| `src/styles/` | Feature CSS imported by `globals.css` — **not** all-in-Tailwind |
| `public/` | Images, partner SVGs (`partnerlogos/`), FMCSA PDFs (`pdfs/`), brand assets |

### `src/components/` breakdown

- **`LandingPage.tsx`** — orchestrates the full homepage; partner pages reuse it with a different `source`.
- **`layout/`** — `LicenseBar`, `Header` (resolves partner from pathname), `Footer`, `Logo`.
- **`sections/`** — landing blocks (`Hero`, `Services`, `Testimonials`, banners, CTAs). Read copy from `content/`.
- **`quote-form/`** — multi-step quote UI; posts to `/api/quote`. Uses Google Places autocomplete via `/api/places/*`.
- **`ui/`** — primitives (`Button`, `Input`, `Select`, `ImageFill`, `Phone`). Prefer extending these over one-offs.
- **`policy/`** — `PolicyPage` renders `LegalDoc` from `content/legal/*`.
- **`promo/`** — `PromoProvider` + modal; config in `content/promo.ts`, triggers in `hooks/usePromoTrigger.ts`.
- **`analytics/`** — client-only tracking helpers such as bounce/session trackers. Do not mount Vercel Speed Insights here; keep it in the root layout.
- **`interactive/`** — sitewide scroll/reveal UX (`RevealManager`, `BackToTop`).

## Route Surface

**Landing pages** (async Server Components → fetch testimonials → `<LandingPage />`):

- `/` — canonical site (`MAIN_SITE` from `content/partners.ts`)
- `/tbm`, `/tbm-primes`, `/top10` — partner landings; same sections, different `source_company` + header logo

**Legal pages** — thin `page.tsx` + `PolicyPage` + metadata from `content/legal/*`:

- `/privacy`, `/terms`, `/sms-privacy`, `/sms-terms`, `/cancellation`

**PDF shortcuts** (route handlers redirect to `/public/pdfs/`):

- `/ready-to-move`, `/your-rights`

**API route handlers**:

- `POST /api/quote` — validate with `quoteFormSchema`, `createFormLead()` (non-blocking on failure), return `estimate()` JSON
- `GET /api/places/autocomplete`, `GET /api/places/details` — server-side Google Places (ZIP autocomplete)

## Partner / Lead Source Model

`content/partners.ts` is the single map from URL slug → API payload:

- `sourceCompany` must match `vantage-main-server` `SOURCE_COMPANIES` (`main_site`, `tbm_leads`, `tbm_prime_leads`, `top10_leads`).
- `Header` calls `resolvePartner(pathname)`; `QuoteForm` sends `source_company` + `source_company_site` on submit.
- Adding a partner: entry in `PARTNERS`, new `src/app/<slug>/page.tsx`, logo under `public/partnerlogos/`.

## Styling Rules

Hybrid CSS — do **not** convert existing sections to utility-only Tailwind.

- `globals.css` imports: `base.css` (tokens/fonts), `primitives.css`, `sections.css`, `quote-form.css`, `promo.css`, `policy.css`.
- Semantic BEM-like classes: `.hero__*`, `.qf__*` (quote form), `.p-*` (policy), `.btn`, `.wrap`.
- Brand tokens in `styles/base.css` (`--navy`, `--gold`, `--trust-blue`). Fonts: Archivo (headings) + Public Sans (body) in root layout.
- Real photos live in `public/`; section backgrounds use `ImageFill` + `SceneName` presets or optional `image` paths in content.

## Content vs Components

- **Edit copy** in `src/content/` (`site.ts` for phone/license/disclaimer, `hero.ts`, `services.ts`, `sections.ts`, `reviews.ts`, `navigation.ts`).
- **Edit structure/behavior** in `src/components/`. Keep legal HTML in content files; `PolicyPage` renders typed blocks (`LegalBlock`).
- `MOVE_SIZES` in `schemas/quote-form.schema.ts` must stay aligned with `vantage-main-server` — no client-side remapping.

## Backend Boundary (`vantage-main-server`)

- **Only** `src/lib/vantage/server.ts` talks to the backend (`import "server-only"`).
- Env: `VANTAGE_API_SECRET` (required), `VANTAGE_API_BASE_URL`, optional `FORM_LEAD_ROUTE`.
- Uses `x-api-secret` header. **Never** expose the secret or call the backend directly from client components.
- `getTestimonials()` — cached fetch, returns `[]` on failure (static `content/reviews.ts` fallback in UI).
- `createFormLead()` — called from `/api/quote`; lead failure is logged but must not block the estimate response.

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Scope | Purpose |
|----------|-------|---------|
| `VANTAGE_API_SECRET` | server | Backend auth |
| `VANTAGE_API_BASE_URL` | server | API host (defaults to Vercel prod URL) |
| `FORM_LEAD_ROUTE` | server | Override form-lead path |
| `GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON` | server | Places autocomplete/details |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_PROMO_*` | client | Promo modal toggles (`content/promo.ts`) |

## Out of Scope / Do Not Use

- `internal_hidden_docs/` — design handoff reference only; excluded from `tsconfig`.
- `estimate()` in `lib/estimate.ts` — placeholder pricing math, not production rates.
- No auth, no Mongo, no admin dashboard — that lives in `vantage-admin` / `vantage-main-server`.

## Quick “Where Do I…?”

| Task | Start here |
|------|------------|
| Change phone, license, disclaimer | `content/site.ts` |
| Add/edit homepage section copy | `content/hero.ts`, `services.ts`, `sections.ts` + matching `components/sections/*` |
| Change quote validation or steps | `schemas/quote-form.schema.ts`, `components/quote-form/QuoteForm.tsx` |
| Wire new lead field to CRM | schema → `app/api/quote/route.ts` → `CreateFormLeadInput` in `lib/vantage/server.ts` |
| Add legal page | `content/legal/<slug>.ts`, `app/<slug>/page.tsx`, link in `content/navigation.ts` |
| Style a section | matching file in `src/styles/`, reuse tokens from `base.css` |

After substantive changes, run `pnpm lint` and `pnpm typecheck`.
